eet up for language exchanges. Free wifi and serves pasta."],["Dos Locos","restaurant",31.22549,121.44529,"Dos Locos - Suite B1-11, South Phase, 1515 Nanjing Xi Lu, near Changde Lu (静安嘉里中心, 南京西路1515号南区B1-11, 近常德路).","","","","","r","A copy of the Mexican-American chain, Chipotle, this restaurant serves large portions of burritos and tacos."],["Beef and Liberty","restaurant",31.228,121.446,"Shanghai Centre, G/F, Shanghai Centre, No.1376 Nanjing Road","","","","","r","A 'premium' beefburger restaurant selling good tasting burgers at a high price."],["Sumerian Coffee","restaurant",31.232,121.448,"415 Shaanxi Bei Lu (near Beijing Xi Lu)","08:00 - 19:00","","","","r","Offers coffee roasted on site (including coffee beans sourced from southern China) and nice wrap sandwiches."],["Pizza Express","restaurant",31.2287,121.4455,"","","","","","r","The UK Pizza chain can be found in the Shanghai Centre. It is better tasting than the fast food pizza joints around Shanghai, albeit at a higher price."],["Uva Cafe","bar",31.231,121.448,"1187 Beijing Xi Lu","08:00 - 21:00","","","","r","A wine bar aimed at the younger set."]]}